msgid "How to use the Multigrid generation in Krita."
msgstr "Ako používať generovanie Multigrid v Krite."

#: ../../reference_manual/layers_and_masks/fill_layer_generators/multigrid.rst:0
msgid ".. image:: /images/layers/multigrid-dimension-example.png"
